    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>renovate, make young again,</i>
